<title>NORWAY: TABLE-BRAATHENS SAFE TRIPLES H1 PRE-TAX.</title>
<headline>TABLE-BRAATHENS SAFE TRIPLES H1 PRE-TAX.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Operating revenues		  2,660	vs    2,080</p>
<p>  Operating profit			224	vs	118</p>
<p>  Pre-tax profit			  235	vs	 77</p>
<p>  Net profit				170	vs	 55</p>
<p>NOTE -- Full name of Norwegian airline company is Braathens SAFE. Braathens SAFE said the half-year figures include Swedish airliner Transwede Airways.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
